OL,3,GNEWSALeeds and Rangers co-owner jailed
OL,4,Aafter prostitution arrest
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeeds and Rangers co-owner Jed York has
OL,7,Fbeen jailed in Ohio after being
OL,8,Farrested for soliciting prostitution.
OL,10,FThe 45-year-old, who is also the owner
OL,11,Fof the San Francisco 49ers, was
OL,12,Fconvicted of disorderly conduct and
OL,13,Fpossessing criminal tools after
OL,14,Fpleading no contest to two charges.
OL,16,FIn the Ohio legal system, a no contest
OL,17,Fplea means a defendant accepts a
OL,18,Fconviction without formally admitting
OL,19,Fguilt.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
