OL,3,GNEWSALeeds and Rangers co-owner jailed
OL,4,Aafter prostitution arrest
OL,5,
OL,6,FYork was sentenced to one day in jail
OL,7,Fon each offence, to be served
OL,8,Fconcurrently, and was given credit for
OL,9,Ftime already served.
